     A* ======================================================================
     A* ORDHDR - Order Header
     A* Author: Arnav    Created: 2026-10-05
     A*
     A* ORDNO is assigned from data area NXTORDNO, never typed (D4).
     A* Customer name is NOT stored - screens look it up from CSTMST.
     A* Deviation from the PDF (D11): ORDNO, CUSTNO, TOTAMT are packed,
     A* not zoned, to match the other files.
     A*
     A* Change log:
     A*   2026-10-05  Arnav  Created (Sprint 1)
     A* ======================================================================
     A                                      UNIQUE
     A          R ORDHREC                   TEXT('Order header record')
     A            ORDNO          7P 0       TEXT('Order number')
     A                                      COLHDG('Order' 'No')
     A            ORDDATE         L         DATFMT(*ISO)
     A                                      TEXT('Order date')
     A                                      COLHDG('Order' 'Date')
     A            CUSTNO         7P 0       TEXT('Customer number')
     A                                      COLHDG('Cust' 'No')
     A            STATUS         1A         TEXT('Order status O=Open')
     A                                      COLHDG('Sts')
     A            TOTAMT        11P 2       TEXT('Order total amount')
     A                                      COLHDG('Total' 'Amount')
     A          K ORDNO
